# .trivyignore -- accepted container-scan exceptions (one CVE ID per line).
#
# The release pipeline fails on ANY unlisted HIGH/CRITICAL finding. To accept a
# specific advisory after review, add its ID below with a justification comment
# (and, where you track it, a re-evaluation date). Keep this list short and
# reviewed -- every entry is a suppressed risk.
#
# Format / example:
#   # CVE-2024-XXXXX: openssl in the base image; no fixed version upstream yet.
#   #   Not reachable from TIC (no inbound TLS termination). Re-evaluate 2025-12.
#   CVE-2024-XXXXX
#
# (empty: no exceptions are currently accepted)
